per_person.template:
{clip}. Look ONLY at the person inside the thick YELLOW box (other people are context).
Give "a": what this person is doing in 3-6 words (where they look, what their hands do), and "s": EXACTLY one of ATTENTIVE (face turned to the camera, looking at it), AVAILABLE (idle, not focused on anything), BUSY (solo task: phone, reading, eating...; or back turned to the camera), ENGAGED (talking or interacting with another person), MOVING (walking to another place during the clip; standing in place is NOT moving).
Raw JSON only: {{"a":"<what they do>","s":"<state>"}}
